      "label": "Folio author",
      "scopeNote": "The person adapting an upstream knowledge-graph asset in their own folio. Chooses which asset to copy and where it belongs, receives the read-only inspection when the session has no write capability, and edits, comments on or raises todos against the copy once it is stamped and verified.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/copy-into-folio.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_MountDependency/Lane_Author",
