      "label": "Code reviewer",
      "scopeNote": "Forks on node kind but never on verdict: Task_ReviewTool catches a skill that is satisfied but whose mechanism is reachable from nowhere, Task_ReviewSchema catches a visual fact with two homes instead of one, and both branches converge on the same Task_RecordVerdict — so whichever kind of node changed, the reader of the finding sees one recording discipline, not two.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/review-code.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_CodeChangeReview/Lane_Reviewer",
