      "label": "Publication manager",
      "scopeNote": "Holds the one call in this subprocess that policy marks unrelaxable: PM_Decide's lane admits a person only, because a pin change is not an edit to the corpus but a change to what the published artefact is BUILT FROM — the fact that puts this decision in the publication manager's lane rather than the editor's, which owns corpus changes elsewhere in this repository.",
      "source": "cat-harness/sdlc/processes/upstream-version-adoption.bpmn"
    },
