      "label": "Agent",
      "scopeNote": "Does every step between the share and the review, and records each decision it made with its reason, so the owner reviews a record rather than an impression.",
      "source": "cat-harness/library/processes/methodology-from-source.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_Translation/Lane_Platform",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/ns/LaneUsage",
      "ofConcept": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/role/authoring-agent",
      "inProcess": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/process/Process_Translation",
      "label": "Agent / platform (automated)",
      "scopeNote": "Everything in this process that runs without asking: extraction to a template, injection of a catalogue, the staleness comparison, and writing the official rendering once sign-off exists. It decides nothing a person would disagree about — every branch it takes is computed from a hash or a file's presence.\n\nIt is one lane rather than two because agentic and mechanical is a judgement rather than a line (see the role model), and nothing in THIS process turns on which of the two ran a step. Where that distinction does matter, the process says so by putting the step in the reviewer's lane instead.",
      "source": "cat-harness/library/processes/translation-workflow.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_CopyIntoFolio/Lane_Agent",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/ns/LaneUsage",
      "ofConcept": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/role/authoring-agent",
      "inProcess": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/process/Process_CopyIntoFolio",
      "label": "Authoring agent",
      "scopeNote": "Probes whether a write capability (`git-push`, `github-api`, or `github-connector`) is available before touching disk or remote refs, writes the copied bytes and the `assets[]` entry into the target folio, and stamps `KgAsset.source` (`{ instance, path, ref }`) in the same change.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/copy-into-folio.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_GraphDetanglement/Lane_Agent",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/ns/LaneUsage",
      "ofConcept": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/role/authoring-agent",
      "inProcess": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/process/Process_GraphDetanglement",
      "label": "Authoring agent",
      "scopeNote": "Runs every stage up to the edge of authorisation — brief, declare, measure, move-and-remeasure, isolate — and Task_Propose is the last thing it does off its own judgement: reporting sizes and what would break, then waiting. Verification here is always by RE-RUNNING the measurement rather than by an assignment being locally reasonable, which is why Task_Move loops back to Task_Measure and not to the gate — a move that looks right is not yet a move that measured right.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/graph-detanglement.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_KgSeparationAuthorise/Lane_Agent",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/ns/LaneUsage",
      "ofConcept": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/role/authoring-agent",
      "inProcess": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/process/Process_KgSeparationAuthorise",
      "label": "Authoring agent",
      "scopeNote": "Briefs, measures the signals, runs declare-detangle-isolate, reports what would move, seeds the repositories once they exist, and adopts each later release. Verification is always by re-running a gate, never by a change looking right.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/kg-separation-authorise.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_KgSeparationMove/Lane_Agent",
      "@type": "https://litlfred.github.io/cat-harness/v0/ns/LaneUsage",
      "ofConcept": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/role/authoring-agent",
      "inProcess": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/process/Process_KgSeparationMove",
      "label": "Authoring agent",
      "scopeNote": "Briefs, measures the signals, runs declare-detangle-isolate, reports what would move, seeds the repositories once they exist, and adopts each later release. Verification is always by re-running a gate, never by a change looking right.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld#glossary-usage/Process_KgSeparation/Lane_Agent",
