      "label": "Validation pipeline",
      "scopeNote": "Verifies that the target folio's newly declared `KgAsset` resolves on disk (`check:declaration-resolution` / `check:declared-assets`), carries a well-formed `KgAsset.source` (`{ instance, path, ref }`), and left the source graph untouched.",
      "source": "cat-harness/processes/kg/copy-into-folio.bpmn"
    },
    {
