      "label": "Validation and QA (mechanical + agents)",
      "scopeNote": "Owns everything except the act of signing: it builds the hashable run, computes the two facts — effectiveReach and whether the API is configured — that Gateway_SigningRoute's table reads rather than a hand-asserted choice, and after either route returns, records which one fired. The record is what lets a later reader know which trust assumption they are relying on without having to ask.",
      "source": "cat-harness/sdlc/processes/qa-report-signing.bpmn"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/role/publish-target",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "prefLabel": "Publish target",
      "title": "Publish target",
      "notation": "publish-target",
      "definition": "GitHub Pages, or wherever the folio is served from. Reached, probed and reported on — never assumed live.",
      "inScheme": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/branches/repin-train-20261113-1024/cat-harness/cat-harness-glossary.jsonld",
      "usage": [
